# eu-r4647 shape: ~2000 declarations, so the runtime SourceMap grows well
# past the low Smid range that baked prelude/xtask Smids occupy. A baked
# Smid that fails to resolve in a small program resolves against an
# UNRELATED USER DECLARATION once the map is this big.
